translate spanish homedinner_74713ef9:

    # R "My apologies, but I must step away for a few minutes to attend to something urgent. However, I am very much looking forward to touring your laboratory, Ms Lora, as soon as I return."
    R "Mis disculpas, pero debo alejarme unos minutos para atender algo urgente. Sin embargo, estoy muy ansioso por recorrer su laboratorio, Srta. Lora, tan pronto como regrese."

# game/script.rpy:1331

translate spanish homedinner_f94e0953:

    # L "What you’re about to witness today is nothing short of an engineering marvel — something that challenges the very path humanity has chosen to follow."
    L "Lo que estás a punto de presenciar hoy no es nada menos que una maravilla de ingeniería — algo que desafía el camino que la humanidad ha elegido seguir."

